<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine 24-hour weather forecast - July 29.</title>
<headline>Philippine 24-hour weather forecast - July 29.</headline>
<text>
<p>++++</p>
<p> STORM ALERT:    All Clear</p>
<p>METRO MANILA --  Partly cloudy to cloudy with rainshowers or</p>
<p>			thunderstorms. Winds light southwest to</p>
<p>			variable. Temp 24-30 C.</p>
<p> BAGUIO	 --  Cloudy with rainshowers or thunderstorms.</p>
<p>Winds</p>
<p>			light to moderate from southwest to variable.</p>
<p>			16-22.</p>
<p> METRO CEBU   --  Partly cloudy to cloudy with rainshowers or</p>
<p>			thunderstorms. Winds light southwest to</p>
<p>			variable. 25-31.</p>
<p>METRO DAVAO  --  Partly cloudy to cloudy with rainshowers or</p>
<p>			thunderstorms. Winds light southwest to</p>
<p>			variable. 25-32.</p>
<p>				     + + + +</p>
</text>
